      "id": "claim_9541cb91d25b462cbf32b283e04f21ae",
      "statement": "Brijio's runtime is an explicit request/response chain (Agent → MCP Server → WebSocket Relay → Browser Extension → Browser Session) where every browser read or action is initiated by an explicit MCP request; the extension is reactive and never streams ambient page/DOM/screenshot/history state.",
